<title>NETHERLANDS: ALANHERI SEES 1996 PROFIT OF DFL 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>ALANHERI SEES 1996 PROFIT OF DFL 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996 (provisional)</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.5  vs   0.26</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Alanheri NV.</p>
<p>    Turnover		    272    vs  513</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>Q4 1996 results (provisional)</p>
<p>    Profit			 1.17  vs    1.04</p>
<p>    Turnover		    91     vs   77.0</p>
<p>Alanheri said the final 1996 figures and the dividend will</p>
<p>be announced on March 11.</p>
</text>
